# ZITLAS — build context for the Railway production image (root .dockerignore)
#
# The root Dockerfile builds ONLY the FastAPI backend; Railway uses it ("Railway
# will always build with a Dockerfile if it finds one"). This file decides what
# is sent to the builder as the build context.
#
# DEFAULT-DENY. Everything is excluded, then exactly the paths the backend
# reads at runtime are re-included, so a new directory (a Flutter build, a test
# harness, node_modules) can never leak into the image by accident.
#
# What the backend reads at runtime (audited from backend/main.py and
# backend/services/*; pinned by backend/tests/test_production_image.py):
#   backend/            the app: routes, services, data/, vector_store/,
#                       recipes/data/, workout/, the knowledge-base PDFs
#   frontend/website/   served by main.py's StaticFiles mount — startup raises
#                       RuntimeError when it is missing
#   food_profiles/      services/food_engine.py _PROFILES_DIR
#   food_dataset/zitlas_food_database_enriched_canonical.json
#                       services/food_engine.py _DATASET_PATH — the NEW
#                       dataset, the only one the food engine serves
#   mobile/assets/images/{10 program,1 month program,3 month}.png
#                       main.py _program_artwork — the program banners
# Not read at runtime: the OLD 4,520-food dataset (the engine refuses it by
# path, without opening it), every other food_dataset file, the rest of
# mobile/ (Flutter is not part of this container), tests/, docs/.

*

!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!backend
!frontend/website
!food_profiles
!food_dataset/zitlas_food_database_enriched_canonical.json
!mobile/assets/images/10 program.png
!mobile/assets/images/1 month program.png
!mobile/assets/images/3 month.png

# ── Never in the image, even inside a re-included path ──────────────────────
# Secrets. Production reads credentials from Railway environment variables
# (FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON, the API keys) — never from a baked-in file.
**/.env
**/*.env
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/*serviceAccountKey*.json
# Tests, caches and local runtime state.
backend/tests
backend/.pytest_cache
backend/uploads
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
# A local, untracked copy of the program banners. main.py serves the tracked
# originals from mobile/assets/images instead.
frontend/website/assets/images/programs

# ── Named explicitly (the default-deny above already excludes them) ─────────
.git
.claude
mobile/build
mobile/.dart_tool
mobile/android/.gradle
mobile/android/build
mobile/ios/Pods
mobile/ios/.symlinks
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
tests
zitlas_test
docs
food_dataset/build
food_dataset/zitlas_food_database_enriched.json
